@startuml
title Dataset Entry Lifecycle - State Diagram
[*] --> Draft
Draft --> Validating : save requested
Validating --> Rejected : text empty
Rejected --> Draft : user edits form
Validating --> Persisted : valid entry
Draft --> AudioPending : audio recorded/attached
AudioPending --> Draft : audio selected
Persisted --> Selected : browse row selected
Selected --> Persisted : deselect
Persisted --> Updated : save changes
Updated --> Persisted
Persisted --> Deleted : delete requested
Deleted --> [*]
@enduml
